# Kaalia of the Vast attacks the opponent; its trigger puts Serra Angel from
# hand onto the battlefield tapped and attacking "that opponent":
# Attacking$ TriggeredDefender, Mode$ Attacks' AbilityKey.Defender
# (TriggerAttacks, SpellAbilityEffect.addToCombat's getDefinedEntities). The
# Angel is unblocked and deals its 4 beside Kaalia's 2.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
queue cardchoice 2
queue attacktarget ai
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
